    "example": "Input: prices = [7, 1, 5, 3, 6, 4]\nOutput: 5",
    "approach": "Track the minimum price so far. At each day the best profit is price − minimum so far. One pass is enough.",
    "code": "def maxProfit(prices):\n    best, lowest = 0, prices[0]\n    for price in prices:\n        lowest = min(lowest, price)\n        best = max(best, price - lowest)\n    return best",
